abstract: >-
  A dimension-reduction study of FIFA 17 Eredivisie player attributes using
  principal component analysis, sparse principal component analysis, and an
  independently implemented penalized matrix decomposition with numerical
  comparison against PMA.
keywords:
  - principal component analysis
  - sparse PCA
  - penalized matrix decomposition
  - dimension reduction
  - sports analytics
  - football analytics
  - R
